--- `max`, `min` or `sum` (a name the core and math share) of a tensor that
--- can fail is a number that can fail, typed by what the tensor holds: it
--- had been typed as nothing known, and the compiled program did not build
--- (the fuzzer's seed 1792144449).
use math
w = [0.5, -1.5] + float['1']
log[max[w]]
log[min[w]]
log[sum[w]]
bad = [0.5, -1.5] + float['x']
m = max[bad]
log[m.ok]
log[m.reason]
